{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117174","id":3367260259,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ItFBj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117174","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117174.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117174.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117174","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117174/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117174/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117174/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/764b92b80e38e0cbeba85e111ecd4892ee690b1e","number":117174,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix keyboard nav in translation preview submenu","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes a minor bug I noticed that no one would bother to report.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"544\" height=\"421\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d6a3098-fbda-4ffb-b494-dff35005fe5a\" />\r\n\r\nIn these kinds of menus, keyboard navigation means that when you do ui_right, you open the submenu and focus its first element. Focusing the first element shouldn't happen for mouse hover.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"639\" height=\"377\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15d313af-caff-40b2-88f1-c6e254b25637\" />\r\n\r\nI noticed that this doesn't happen for the translation preview submenu, because it's generated on the about_to_popup signal. So I either had to either:\r\na)  Change EditorTranslationPreviewMenu to be generated earlier, or\r\nb) Change PopupMenu itself.\r\n\r\nI decided to do the latter, as I don't see why the keyboard focus for submenus wouldn't happen only after it's been popped up. This might fix other similar bugs I don't know about and I can't think of any way it would cause regressions.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","des